# Local-only avatar pipeline test assets (third-party IP — not for commit/deploy)
web/public/ragatha_test*.glb
web/public/vrm_test.glb
# scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/ is an allowlist. The folder accumulates one-off
# Blender probes written to chase a single artifact (a smeared weight, a dark
# vertex, a bad viseme) plus heavy derived output - GLB iterations and QA render
# sheets, ~1.4 GB at its peak. Those belong on the disk of whoever is mid
# investigation, never in the repo. Ignore rules do not untrack anything, so
# everything already committed here stays committed; this only stops NEW churn
# from being swept in by `git add -A`. To keep a new tool, `git add -f` it.
scripts/avatar-rig-transfer/*

# Snapshot of the assembled Live system prompt (scripts/reload_knowledge.py).
# Generated from Supabase, so it goes stale the moment a digest changes.
docs/*.generated.txt
# NOTE: custom_avatar.glb (Manglara, the foundation's own character) IS committed
# so the deployed app can serve it (avatar 404'd in prod otherwise). If you move
# it to a CDN, set VITE_AVATAR_URL instead and re-add the ignore below.
